# Lint and format

After making code changes in this project, always run:

```bash
npm run lint
npm run format
```

Fix any ESLint errors before considering the task done. Prefer `npm run lint:fix` when auto-fixable issues exist (runs ESLint `--fix` and `prettier:fix`), then re-run `npm run lint`.

Do not skip these scripts because the change seemed small.
